<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's China Airlines H1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's China Airlines H1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    24,890 vs 22,953</p>
<p>    Net profit			     344 vs    403</p>
<p>NOTE - China Airlines is Taiwan's largest airline company.</p>
<p>The firm attributed the profit decline to oil price rises in the first half of this year over the year-earlier period, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
